              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ana ma Leuveni ĩkithathi ya Isilaeli (nũndũ aĩ ĩkithathi; ĩndĩ, nĩkwĩthĩwa nĩwathũkisye ũkomo wa ĩthe wake, ũkithathi wake wanengiwe ana ma Yosevu mwana wa Isilaeli; na ũsyaanĩo ti wa kũtalwa kũatĩĩa ũkithathi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
